</table>
<p style="margin-top:12pt;padding-top:7pt;border-top:1pt solid #d2d4db;font-size:8.5pt;color:#5d6068">Companion documents: <b>3 &mdash; UI Design System</b> (every visual value and component usage rule), <b>5 &mdash; Visualization UI &amp; BFF Architecture on AWS</b> (the experience API these pages call, its module structure, and both deployment models), <b>1 &mdash; Architecture Decision Records</b> (the reasoning behind each decision above). Open items: the Tasks module contract (&sect;13.4); whether step-level results are recorded inside an invoked sub-graph; and whether accent is user-selectable in addition to theme &mdash; the design system currently specifies a single fixed accent.</p>

